00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,000
Kidnapped: Elizabeth Smart is a documentary, crime
film directed by Benedict Sanderson.

2
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:06,000
Elizabeth Smart's harrowing abduction at 14 from her family's Utah home unfolds
through her own words and never-before-seen material in this documentary.

