01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Amber Marshall (born June 2, 1988) is a Canadian
actress, singer, and equestrian.

10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
She has appeared in several television films and series, most notably as
Amy Fleming in the long-running CBC/Up TV series Heartland.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
For her performance in the series, Marshall won the inaugural Canada's
Screen Star Award at the 1st Canadian Screen Awards.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film explores themes of kidnapping, utah, psychology, trauma, victim.
